---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const updated = "27 October 2026";
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy - Project Binder"
	description="Privacy Policy for Project Binder cloud and website."
>
	<section class="legal">
		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="legal-meta">Last updated: {updated}</p>

		<p>
			This policy explains how Gábor Pintér (“we”, “us”), a sole entrepreneur in
			Hungary (tax number: 46117201133), handles personal data for the Project
			Binder website and hosted cloud service.
		</p>
		<p>
			Self-hosted installations you run yourself are outside this policy. You are
			the controller of that data.
		</p>

		<h2>1. What we collect</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Account data:</strong> email address and authentication details
				needed to sign in.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>App content:</strong> projects, tasks, notes, files, timelogs,
				databases, and similar data you create in the cloud app.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Newsletter:</strong> email address if you subscribe (double
				opt-in / confirmation where used).
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Transactional email:</strong> email used for confirmations,
				account messages, and billing-related mail.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Payments:</strong> subscription and customer identifiers from
				Polar. Card details are handled by Polar, not stored by us.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Website analytics:</strong> privacy-oriented usage metrics via
				Cloudflare Web Analytics.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Feedback:</strong> whatever you submit through our feedback form
				(hosted by Tally, when that form is used).
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>2. Why we use it</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>To provide and secure the cloud service</li>
			<li>To send transactional email related to your account</li>
			<li>To send the newsletter when you have subscribed</li>
			<li>To process Cloud Pro subscriptions via Polar</li>
			<li>To understand aggregate website traffic (Cloudflare Web Analytics)</li>
			<li>To respond to feedback and support requests</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			We do not sell your personal data. We do not share it with third parties for
			their advertising. We use service providers only as needed to operate
			Project Binder.
		</p>

		<h2>3. Service providers</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Cloudflare</strong> (United States / global network): website
				hosting (Pages) and Web Analytics.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Fly.io</strong> (Amsterdam region for the app): cloud app
				hosting.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Resend</strong> (United States): newsletter and transactional
				email.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Polar</strong> (Ireland and Sweden): payments and subscriptions.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Tally</strong> (when used): feedback form submissions.
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			Some providers process data outside Hungary, including in the United States.
			They act as processors for the purposes above.
		</p>

		<h2>4. How long we keep it</h2>
		<p>
			Cloud account and app data are kept while your account is active. If you
			delete your account in the app, your user data is deleted immediately.
		</p>
		<p>
			Newsletter emails are kept until you unsubscribe. Billing records may be
			kept as required for accounting and tax law. Analytics data is retained
			according to Cloudflare’s product settings.
		</p>

		<h2>5. Sharing and public links</h2>
		<p>
			Content you share through public or read-only links is accessible to anyone
			with the link. You are responsible for what you choose to share.
		</p>

		<h2>6. Your rights</h2>
		<p>
			Under GDPR (and related EU rules), you may request access, correction,
			deletion, or export of your personal data, and you may object to or restrict
			certain processing. You can withdraw newsletter consent at any time by
			unsubscribing.
		</p>
		<p>
			To exercise these rights, email{" "}
			<a href="mailto:hello@gaborpinter.com">hello@gaborpinter.com</a>. You may
			also lodge a complaint with the Hungarian National Authority for Data
			Protection and Freedom of Information (NAIH).
		</p>

		<h2>7. Cookies and analytics</h2>
		<p>
			We use Cloudflare Web Analytics on the marketing site. It is designed to be
			privacy-friendly and is not used for advertising. Essential cookies or
			storage may be used for the cloud app to keep you signed in and run the
			product.
		</p>

		<h2>8. Age</h2>
		<p>The cloud service is intended for users aged 18 and over.</p>

		<h2>9. Changes</h2>
		<p>
			We may update this policy. The “Last updated” date will change when we do.
			Material changes may also be noted on the website or by email when
			appropriate.
		</p>

		<h2>10. Contact</h2>
		<p>
			Privacy questions:{" "}
			<a href="mailto:hello@gaborpinter.com">hello@gaborpinter.com</a>.
		</p>
	</section>
</Layout>
